  "title": "Five-finger position: left hand",
  "summary": "The mirror image: little finger on C, thumb on G.",
  "steps": [
    {
      "type": "explain",
      "title": "Left hand in C position",
      "body": "Put your left little finger (5) on the C below middle C and rest one finger on each white key going up. Your thumb (1) lands on G.\n\nBecause the left hand is a mirror, playing 5, 4, 3, 2, 1 goes **up** the keyboard, and 1, 2, 3, 4, 5 goes down.",
